@host = http://localhost:8090
@fileId = replace-with-file-id

### Upload a file
POST {{host}}/api/v1/files
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ReonBoundary

------ReonBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello from reon
------ReonBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

{"originalName":"hello.txt","contentType":"text/plain","description":"greeting","tags":{"kind":"demo"}}
------ReonBoundary--

### Metadata
GET {{host}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}/metadata

### Download
GET {{host}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready
